insert into public.services (slug, title, icon, description, short_description, benefits, sort_order) values
('residential-cleaning','Residential Cleaning','🏠','Your home deserves a clean, fresh, and healthy environment. Our residential cleaning service helps homeowners maintain spotless living spaces through the cleaning of bedrooms, sitting rooms, kitchens, bathrooms, floors, windows, and other household areas. Whether you need regular home cleaning or a one-time service, DE DON DC is ready to help you enjoy a cleaner and more comfortable home.','Regular or one-time cleaning for bedrooms, kitchens, bathrooms, floors and more.',array['Regular or one-time cleaning','Bedrooms, kitchens, bathrooms, floors and windows','A cleaner, more comfortable home'],1),
('commercial-cleaning','Commercial Cleaning','🏢','A clean business environment creates a positive impression on customers, visitors, and employees. Our commercial cleaning service is designed for offices, shops, showrooms, business centres, and other commercial properties. We clean floors, windows, workstations, restrooms, and shared spaces to help businesses maintain a professional appearance and a pleasant working environment.','Cleaning for offices, shops, showrooms and business centres.',array['Offices, shops, showrooms and business centres','Floors, windows, workstations and restrooms','A professional appearance'],2),
('janitorial-services','Janitorial Services','🧹','Keeping a facility clean every day requires consistency and attention to detail. Our janitorial services provide routine cleaning and upkeep for offices, schools, commercial buildings, and other establishments. Services may include sweeping, mopping, dusting, waste disposal, restroom cleaning, and maintaining shared spaces. We help clients keep their facilities neat, organised, and ready for daily activities.','Routine daily cleaning and upkeep for offices, schools and commercial buildings.',array['Routine daily upkeep','Sweeping, mopping, dusting and waste disposal','Neat, organised facilities'],3),
('deep-cleaning','Deep Cleaning','✨','Sometimes, ordinary cleaning is not enough. Our deep cleaning service focuses on areas that are often overlooked during routine cleaning, including difficult corners, hidden dirt, stubborn stains, and hard-to-reach surfaces. We thoroughly clean kitchens, bathrooms, floors, fixtures, and other areas according to the needs of each property. Deep cleaning is ideal for homes and businesses that require a more intensive cleaning treatment.','Intensive cleaning of overlooked corners, stubborn stains and hard-to-reach surfaces.',array['Difficult corners and hard-to-reach surfaces','Hidden dirt and stubborn stains','Suited to homes and businesses'],4),
('post-construction-cleaning','Post-Construction Cleaning','🏗️','After construction or renovation, buildings are often left with dust, debris, paint marks, and other unwanted materials. Our post-construction cleaning service helps transform newly built or renovated spaces into cleaner environments that are ready for inspection, furnishing, or occupation. We remove construction dust, clean floors and windows, wipe surfaces, and address other cleaning needs to give your property a neat and presentable finish.','Dust, debris and paint marks removed after building or renovation.',array['Construction dust removed','Floors, windows and surfaces cleaned','Ready for inspection, furnishing or occupation'],5),
('kitchen-cleaning-sanitation','Kitchen Cleaning and Sanitation','🍽️','The kitchen is one of the most important areas to keep clean because it is where food is prepared. Our kitchen cleaning and sanitation service targets grease, food stains, dirt, and other residues on worktops, sinks, cabinets, floors, and suitable kitchen equipment. We help maintain a cleaner food-preparation environment by using appropriate cleaning methods and products suited to the surfaces being treated.','Grease, food stains and residues removed from worktops, sinks, cabinets and floors.',array['Grease, food stains and residues targeted','Worktops, sinks, cabinets, floors and suitable equipment','Methods suited to each surface'],6),
('carpet-upholstery-care','Carpet and Upholstery Care','🛋️','Carpets, sofas, chairs, and other upholstered furniture can collect dust, stains, odours, and everyday dirt. Our carpet and upholstery care service helps restore the appearance and freshness of these items through suitable cleaning techniques. We assess the material and condition before selecting an appropriate treatment. Regular professional care can help maintain the appearance and extend the useful life of your carpets and furniture.','Restoring the look and freshness of carpets, sofas and upholstered furniture.',array['Dust, stains and odours addressed','Material assessed before treatment','Helps extend the life of carpets and furniture'],7),
('medical-facility-sanitation','Medical Facility Sanitation','🏥','Medical environments require special attention to cleanliness and hygiene. Our medical facility sanitation service is designed for healthcare settings such as clinics, consulting rooms, and other medical facilities. Depending on the facility''s requirements, cleaning may cover floors, waiting areas, restrooms, frequently touched surfaces, and other designated spaces. We use appropriate cleaning and sanitation procedures while respecting the facility''s infection-prevention protocols and requirements for safe handling of waste.','Cleaning and sanitation for clinics, consulting rooms and other healthcare settings.',array['Floors, waiting areas and restrooms','Frequently touched surfaces','Respects infection-prevention and waste-handling requirements'],8),
('facility-maintenance','Facility Management','🔧','A well-maintained facility supports comfort, safety, and efficient daily operations. Our facility management service helps property owners and organisations keep their buildings and surrounding areas in good condition. Depending on the agreed scope of work, services may include routine inspections, reporting maintenance issues, coordinating repairs, and maintaining common areas. Our goal is to help clients protect their properties, reduce avoidable disruptions, and maintain a functional environment.','Keeping buildings and surrounding areas in good condition, to an agreed scope of work.',array['Routine inspections and issue reporting','Repairs coordinated','Common areas maintained'],9),
('fumigation-services','Fumigation Services','🛡️','Unwanted insects and other pests can make homes and business premises uncomfortable. Our fumigation services help address pest problems using appropriate treatment methods based on the type of pest, the affected area, and the property''s requirements. We prioritise safe handling, suitable products, and relevant precautions before, during, and after treatment. Our aim is to help clients maintain cleaner and more comfortable environments while following applicable safety guidelines.','Treatment for insects and other pests in homes and business premises.',array['Treatment matched to the pest and area','Safe handling and suitable products','Precautions before, during and after treatment'],10),
('pest-control','Pest Control','🐜','Pests such as cockroaches, ants, rodents, flies, and mosquitoes can create sanitation problems and damage property. Our pest control service focuses on identifying pest concerns and applying suitable control measures. Depending on the situation, this may include treatment, recommendations for preventing re-infestation, and guidance on improving sanitation and reducing conditions that attract pests. We help homes and businesses take practical steps towards maintaining a cleaner, more comfortable environment.','Identifying pest concerns and applying suitable control measures.',array['Pest concerns identified','Treatment and re-infestation prevention advice','Sanitation guidance'],11),
('hotel-serviced-apartment-cleaning','Hotel and Serviced-Apartment Cleaning','🛎️','We provide professional cleaning services for hotels, serviced apartments, and short-let properties, ensuring every room and facility is clean, fresh, hygienic, and welcoming. From bedrooms and bathrooms to kitchens and common areas, our team delivers reliable cleaning that enhances guest comfort and maintains high standards of cleanliness.','Cleaning for hotels, serviced apartments and short-let properties.',array['Bedrooms, bathrooms, kitchens and common areas','Clean, fresh, hygienic and welcoming rooms','Reliable cleaning that supports guest comfort'],12),
('glass-windows-tiles-cleaning','Glass, Windows, Tiles and Alucobond Cleaning','🪟','We specialise in cleaning glass surfaces, windows, floor and wall tiles, and Alucobond panels to restore their shine and enhance the appearance of your property. Our professional approach removes dirt, stains, dust, and grime, leaving surfaces looking clean, bright, and well-maintained for homes, offices, hotels, and commercial buildings.','Restoring the shine of glass, windows, tiles and Alucobond panels.',array['Glass, windows, floor and wall tiles, and Alucobond panels','Dirt, stains, dust and grime removed','For homes, offices, hotels and commercial buildings'],13)
